### Llistar tots els productes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Obtenir producte per ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Producte inexistent (esperar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Buscar per nom (parcial)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=poma
Accept: application/json

### Comptar productes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/count
Accept: application/json

### Productes per categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Fruita
Accept: application/json

### Productes per categoria (Lactis)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Lactis
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar per categoria i preu màxim
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/filter?category=Fruita&maxPrice=1.50
Accept: application/json

### Estadístiques
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/stats
Accept: application/json
